1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
爬遍中国五岳，他却说：够了。
He climbed all Five Great Peaks — then quit.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:05,000
让他封山的，就是黄山。
The one that made him stop: Huangshan.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,400
88座千米高峰，挤成一片。
88 summits over a thousand meters.

4
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,900
云在脚下，翻涌成海。
Clouds roll into a sea below your feet.

5
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:12,300
松树，从石缝里长出来。
Pines grow straight out of bare rock.

6
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:14,700
一棵迎客松，等了上千年。
One greeting pine has waited a thousand years.

7
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:17,200
天一亮，云海染成金色。
At dawn, the sea of clouds turns gold.

8
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:20,000
徐霞客说：黄山归来不看岳。
Xu Xiake: "After Huangshan, no peak remains."

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,200
云海还是日出，你先追哪个？
Sea of clouds or sunrise — which first?
